---
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Little Light Below — Support"
  eyebrow="光落深境 · Help & Support"
  lead="A little light. A long way down."
  description="Controls, local saves, Landing Coach, Lantern Echo and support contact for Little Light Below / 光落深境."
  width="narrow"
>
  <article class="prose">
    <p>Little Light Below / 光落深境 is an offline cave adventure by Kuan-Hao Chao. Guide Explorer, Mossling, Tock or Lumen through eight painted worlds with left, right and each traveler’s ability. All travelers, outfits, lantern colors and footstep styles are available from the start.</p>

    <h2>Start and controls</h2>
    <p>Choose Begin on the home screen for the expedition, or Continue to return to an interrupted run. Hold the left or right control to steer; use the ability button when its cooldown is ready. Settings also offers optional cave-half steering. Open the Wardrobe to choose a traveler, inspect its ability and preview walking or running.</p>
    <p>Settings includes English or Traditional Chinese, reduced effects, sound and haptic controls. Decorative artwork and ordinary text do not respond to a long press. The explicit seed and challenge editors remain available for entering a course.</p>

    <h2>The Heart Lantern and resting lights</h2>
    <p>Restore the eight chapter beacons to open the Heartwell at floor 160. Its final ten floors have no chasing ceiling: land on each numbered light switch before passing its gate, then reach the Heart Lantern. Every traveler can finish without a required ability. A missed connection offers a retry instead of leaving you trapped.</p>
    <p>Story difficulty saves resting lights seven and fourteen floors into each chapter, plus the finale’s circuit boundaries. A checkpoint retry restores health and keeps pending discoveries and total active time. It counts for story progress; uninterrupted times and no-damage awards remain separate. Adventure and Expert restart the whole stage. Ordinary background resume keeps your current run.</p>
    <p>Optional three-light trails begin eight floors into each chapter. Repair their relays and bring a waiting traveler to the beacon to keep the rescue. Beacons add new features to the refuge. Relics do not gate the main ending; all 24 recovered memories unlock an extra constellation scene afterward. Camp offers story replays and links to the Journal and crew.</p>

    <h2>Landing Coach</h2>
    <p>After a failed run, a short tip may offer “Practice this footing.” This opens a ten-floor Mechanic Lab at 80% pace with the same traveler and world. “Retry original run” starts that course again from the beginning. Practice does not award competitive records or chapter progress.</p>

    <h2>Lantern Echo</h2>
    <p>Winning a new best time in Trial or Daily can record a small local route. Choose “Race your lantern” to show a lantern following that route on the matching course, with the same traveler. Older records without a recorded route remain valid. Your Echo does not collide, change scores, or alter the course, and its display is optional.</p>

    <h2>Progress, offline play and interruptions</h2>
    <p>Gameplay does not need an internet connection or account. Progress stays in this app’s storage on the device; there is no automatic transfer between Apple and Android phones. Switching apps or taking an interruption pauses the run. Resume it explicitly when you return. Avoid removing the app if you want to retain its local progress.</p>
    <p>If artwork cannot load, use the displayed Retry action. If the game remains unresponsive, close and reopen it. Include the app version, device model, operating system, mode, traveler and course seed or Daily date when reporting a problem. A screenshot or short recording can help; do not send passwords or signing credentials.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> for support. Read the <a href="/games/little-light-below/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for local storage and sharing details. The <a href="/games/100-floor-descent/">original browser edition</a> remains available separately.</p>

    <section lang="zh-Hant" aria-label="繁體中文支援">
      <h2>繁體中文支援</h2>
      <p>在主畫面選擇開始探險，或按繼續返回中斷的旅程。長按左右按鈕控制方向，技能冷卻完成後可使用角色技能；也可在設定開啟洞窟左右半邊操作。衣櫥可選擇角色、服裝、燈火與足跡，並預覽行走及奔跑。</p>
      <p>重燃八盞信標，即可進入第 160—170 層的心燈井。先踩亮編號開關，再穿過對應的門，接通三條迴路，讓心燈醒來。每位旅伴都能完成，不需要特定技能，也不需要收集遺物。二十四段完整記憶則會開啟可選的星空後日談。</p>
      <p>故事難度在每章第七、十四層，以及心燈井迴路之間儲存休息燈。重試會恢復生命、保留待帶回的發現與累積遊玩時間；全程時間與無傷獎章另計。冒險、專家難度重新開始整段關卡。每章第八層起的三燈岔路提供可選救援，抵達信標後才會永久保留。</p>
      <p>失敗後的「落點教練」提示可帶你進入 80% 速度的十層機關練習室，再重新挑戰原課程。「燈火回聲」可在同角色、同課程的百層挑戰或每日小徑中，重播你自己的最佳成功路線，顯示與否由你決定。</p>
      <p>遊戲可離線進行，進度只儲存在本機，不會自動在 Apple 與 Android 之間同步。切換 App 時會暫停，回來後請自行繼續。移除 App 可能會失去本機進度。</p>
      <p>需要協助時請寄信至 <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>，並附上遊戲版本、裝置型號、系統版本、模式、角色、課程種子或每日日期。請勿提供密碼或簽署憑證。</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
